    <Shape Type="Text" CutIndex="0" Font="Sans Serif,-1,100,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" Str="Yes, I am a criminal. My crime is that of curiosity — &#10;judging people by what they say and think, not what &#10;they look like. My crime is that of outsmarting you, &#10;something you will never forgive me for." H="6.1259637" LS="0" LnS="0" Ah="1" Av="1" Weld="1" HasBackupPath="1">
